istian converts but Hindus. As such they could not of course be accused of heresy or apostasy. Nevertheless, they attracted Inquisition attention usually for breaching the strict prohibition on participating in non-Catholic rites in Portuguese territory." '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 861, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 782})
